    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist EXTERMINATION SHIP to get news about the game.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205570/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.poster.avif?t=1744524276\" width=604 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205570/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.webm?t=1744524276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205570/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.mp4?t=1744524276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205570/extras/33afa27a71614163af20c4125bc084b9.avif?t=1744524276\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><br>Your task is simple \u2014 <strong>survive</strong> aboard a massive vessel navigating the open waters. But each day brings new challenges, and gradually you begin to realize that the familiar routine is becoming a <i>dangerous trap</i>. Disappearing crew members, strange noises in the corridors, and a foggy unknown shrouding the ship from the outside world\u2014all make you question what's real and what's a figment of your imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205570/extras/9a88ec2af1d1cc11431990649b221eb1.avif?t=1744524276\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><br>Every day you perform your duties, but with each step, there is a growing sense that something sinister is lurking behind the ship's walls. Impenetrable fog beyond the deck and the vanishing faces of the crew make you wonder: are you <i>truly alone</i> on this ship? Walk through the empty corridors and discover what really happened to your colleagues.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205570/extras/1592125d44fca74dbde4e3ef936df921.avif?t=1744524276\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><br>Keep your sanity intact by handling daily tasks and trying not to succumb to your fears. But remember: <strong>something waits in the shadows</strong>, ready to reveal its intentions when you least expect it. Are you prepared to face what this ship hides? Are you ready to endure <i>14 days</i> that will change your perception of reality?",
